WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.687
Step 1. Open the list of appointments.

1.2
00:00:02.687 --> 00:00:07.561
You print a list of appointments from the List view of an Appointments page.

1.3
00:00:07.561 --> 00:00:11.781
Select List. The Print button shows only in the list view.

2.1
00:00:11.781 --> 00:00:14.064
Step 2. Choose what to print.

2.2
00:00:14.064 --> 00:00:18.691
The printout covers the practitioners in the Practitioners filter,

2.3
00:00:18.691 --> 00:00:24.378
the statuses of the open tab, here Booked, and the date range, here today.

3.1
00:00:24.378 --> 00:00:26.376
Step 3. Select Print.

3.2
00:00:26.376 --> 00:00:33.537
If the date range has no start date, or is 31 days or longer, Print is disabled.

4.1
00:00:33.537 --> 00:00:36.045
Step 4. Check the print preview.

4.2
00:00:36.045 --> 00:00:40.563
The preview has the title Appointments and shows the Date Range,

4.3
00:00:40.563 --> 00:00:43.104
Generated on and Total Appointments.

4.4
00:00:43.104 --> 00:00:47.768
To sort the rows by token number, turn on Sort by Token No.

5.1
00:00:47.768 --> 00:00:50.716
Step 5. Print the list. Print the preview.

5.2
00:00:50.716 --> 00:00:56.291
You get a printed list of the appointments that match your choices on the list.
